# Changelog 🧾
{{#each releases}}
  ## Release {{title}}
  > {{niceDate}}
  {{#if merges.length}}
    ### Merged to Main 🔀
    {{#each merges}}
      - {{message}} [{{id}}]({{href}})
    {{/each}}
  {{/if}}
  {{#if commits.length}}
    ### Features ✨
    {{#each commits}}
      - {{subject}}, [{{shorthash}}]({{href}}) --{{author}}
    {{/each}}
  {{/if}}
  {{#if fixes.length}}
    ### Fixes 🐛
    {{#each fixes}}
      - {{commit}}, {{commit.subject}} [{{id}}]({{href}})
    {{/each}}
  {{/if}}
{{/each}}
